@startuml
!theme plain
title Permission-Aware Bulk Upload from the Unified Work Area
actor "Lecturer / HOD / Administrator / Coordinator / Reviewer" as User
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Policy Decision Point" as PDP
participant "Bulk Upload API" as API
participant "Manifest Validator" as MV
participant "Ingestion Job" as JOB
participant "Version Service" as VS
database "Metadata Store" as DB
collections "Object Storage" as OS
participant "Notification Service" as NOTIFY

User -> UI: Click contextual Bulk upload action
UI -> PDP: Can actor upload this content to this scope?
alt not authorised
  PDP --> UI: Deny with safe explanation
else authorised
  PDP --> UI: Permit + allowed targets/classifications
  User -> UI: Add files/ZIP + metadata defaults
  UI -> API: Submit manifest and file handles
  API -> MV: Validate schema, target, rights and limits
  alt validation fails
    MV --> UI: Item-level errors; no commit
  else valid
    MV -> JOB: Queue idempotent batch
    JOB -> VS: Check checksum and content identity
    alt exact duplicate
      VS -> DB: Record duplicate observation, preserve existing version
    else revised/alternative/new content
      VS -> OS: Store immutable object
      VS -> DB: Append version with actor, timestamp and relationship
    end
    JOB -> DB: Save batch and per-item outcomes
    JOB -> NOTIFY: Completion summary
    NOTIFY --> UI: Ready / review required / rejected counts
  end
end
@enduml
